  "body": "What is the expected rendering here? (Hover the fieldset.)\r\n\r\nhttp://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/6205\r\n\r\n```\r\n<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<style>\r\nfieldset { height: 30px; margin: 0; border: 20px solid green; padding: 0px; }\r\nlegend { height: 0px; background: lime; transition: height 5s }\r\nfieldset:hover legend { height: 160px }\r\n</style>\r\n<fieldset><legend>X</legend>HELLO</fieldset>\r\n```\r\n\r\nBrowsers disagree. Safari even disagrees with itself depending on whether you set the height with a transition or have it there [without a transition](http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/6206).\r\n\r\ncc @whatwg/fieldset ",
